      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A player just confirmed that it worked for them. They apparently merged their old oculus account with a newly created vrc one.\n\nI'm unsure if this is fixed or if it only happens under certain conditions.\n\nI have another ticket that I made here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/persistence/p/persistence-data-get-deleted-upon-linking-a-vrchat-to-your-steam-account\n\nProbably can be combined with this one.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
