  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-06-23T22:33:13.939Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Users have reported that their persistence data was lost when they merged their meta account with a VRChat web account. \n\nI'm thinking whichever account has the most play time should probably win so players don't lose progress in game worlds.\n\nUnfortunately world creators have no access to user persistence data so we can't solve problems with lost data in our worlds.",
